{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39822","headline":"题吴中陆龟蒙山斋 · 殷文圭","name":"题吴中陆龟蒙山斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万卷图书千户贵，十洲烟景四时和。\n花心露洗猩猩血，水面风披瑟瑟罗。\n庄叟静眠清梦永，客儿芳意小诗多。\n天麟不触人间网，拟把公卿换得麽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}